  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Alone in his quiet house, the protagonist remembers post-war Fukushima when he was a boy. His mother discovers his father spent the money meant to buy rice for his younger brother—and later that night, his father whispers a bitter lesson about money and freedom. Listen to this childhood memory.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "仕事に戻って稼いでくればいいだろう！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "konosuke",
      "t": "黙ってろ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "あんた、まさか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "あれはとおるに米を食べさせるお金だったのに！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "konosuke",
      "t": "うるさい！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "やめろ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "お前、何をやってるんだ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "ごめんなさい、ごめんなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "父ちゃん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "父ちゃん、ごめんな。許してくれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "konosuke",
      "t": "結局、金がないと自由にもなれないんだな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "金と自由か。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Even in these raw childhood memories, the everyday words are short and direct. Let's look at each one.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "仕事に戻って稼いでくればいいだろう！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''You should go back to work and earn money!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "konosuke",
      "t": "黙ってろ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Keep quiet!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "あんた、まさか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Wait—surely you did not.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "あれはとおるに米を食べさせるお金だったのに！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''That was the money to feed rice to Toru!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kozue",
      "t": "ごめんなさい、ごめんなさい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''I am sorry, I am so sorry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "父ちゃん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Dad.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "許してくれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Please forgive me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "konosuke",
      "t": "結局、金がないと自由にもなれないんだな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In the end, without money you cannot even become free.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "金と自由か。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Money and freedom, huh.'",
      "gap": 0.9
